    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Tidal Surge",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "primal"
      ],
      "text": "The dragon sweeps their wings, creating a 30-foot cone of buffeting water that deals 14d8 bludgeoning damage with a DC 42 basic Fortitude save save. Each unattended object and each creature that fails the save is also pushed away from the dragon 20 feet (30 feet on a critical failure) and is knocked Prone. The dragon can't use Tidal Surge again for 1d4 rounds."
